      { id: 13, type: "short_answer", q: `Which Chinese text recorded gnomon shadow measurements for solstices?`, answer: `Zhoubi Suanjing`, acceptedAnswers: [`the Zhoubi Suanjing`], explanation: `'The Zhoubi Suanjing (1046 BCE) records gnomon shadow measurements to determine solstices'.` }
