      { id: 13, type: "short_answer", q: `How many native forest bird species did brown tree snakes eliminate on Guam?`, answer: `10`, acceptedAnswers: [`ten`, `10 of 12`], explanation: `Brown tree snakes 'eliminated 10 of 12 native forest birds on Guam'.` }
